  "interpretation": [
    "No observed shared texture-ID capacity exhaustion; peak8 of16 in both spatial workloads. This does not establish arbitrary workload sufficiency or AXI bandwidth saturation.",
    "Fetch occupies about76% of active texture-unit clocks. Most fetch clocks have one or two outstanding physical leaders; four-leader occupancy is rare.",
